			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize Element submodule for IPC diagnostic hooks and bridge retry logic\n\nAdvance the Element submodule from fa903600e1 to bf55904456, introducing safeguards for the Tauri IPC bridge between Mountain and Sky to prevent initialization race conditions and aid debugging.\n\nKey modifications:\n- **Mountain**: Inject a diagnostic script at `document_start` in `WindowBuild.rs` to populate `window.__MOUNTAIN_TAURI_DIAG`. This captures early IPC bridge state (`window.__TAURI_INTERNALS__`, `window.__TAURI__`) and lifecycle timestamps before application scripts execute, enabling DevTools verification of capability scoping without full bundle loading.\n- **Sky**: Replace the synchronous check for `__TAURI__` globals in `Layout.astro` with a 5-second polling loop (`ResolveInvoke`, `WaitForInvoke`). This addresses race conditions where ES-module evaluation outpaces Wry's content-script injection, which previously caused silent drops of lifecycle phases (e.g., `lifecycle:advancePhase(3)`).\n\nTogether these changes eliminate startup race conditions causing \"Sky did not advance to Restored\" errors and provide a dedicated diagnostic surface for early IPC failure detection.",
			"SHA": "8633e6dd793e8003057a2bfcfa2f0ba3192f3882"
		},
